---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import coverage from '../data/image-coverage.json';
---
<Base title="Image search | Litbuy Sheet Lab"><main class="image-search-page"><p class="eyebrow">LITBUY SHEET LAB</p><h1 data-home-aria="image_search">Image search</h1><p>Choose a product image to find visually similar products. Your image stays in your browser.</p><div class="upload-box"><label id="image-upload-label" for="image-upload"><span class="upload-icon" aria-hidden="true">＋</span><strong>Choose an image</strong><span>Click to upload or drop a product photo here</span><small>JPG · PNG · WebP · up to 15 MB</small><input id="image-upload" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"/></label><img id="query-image-preview" alt="Your selected search image" hidden/><p id="image-search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><p class="data-note">{coverage.indexedKnownImages?.toLocaleString('en-US')||'All available'} known catalog and seller images are indexed, plus guide illustrations and site logos. {coverage.unavailableImages||0} known source images could not be retrieved. Matching is approximate; newly changed seller options may need the next index refresh.</p><div class="image-search-info"><h2>Visually similar products</h2><p>After selecting an image, results open in the Litbuy Sheet Lab product list, ordered by approximate visual similarity.</p></div></main></Base>